    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join in Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/7c948c6469cb8f1e211c2cbe49e2a651.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hainya World EA 2.0 Major Update!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/d0b564b92a48ecd3a52115fd6a43c1df.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a whole year of development, it's finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've revamped many game mechanics, significantly enhanced the visuals, and added even more fun gameplay elements!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the Hainya World!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An RPG of Adventure x Creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig, build, battle, and explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight monsters, level up, break terrain, and gather materials to build your own base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The kingdom is under attack by monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To save it, adventurers set off to explore an ancient continent in search of untold mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/e8f846a1942e2fd7540a380691692ac8.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Venture into the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Ancient Land</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A forgotten ancient continent, where adventurers journey to investigate abnormal monster activity. Here, they can freely alter the terrain and construct structures to explore this unknown region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Narus Continent</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The homeland of adventurers and the main continent where the hainyaworld people live. It is home to many prosperous towns and residents. You can visit this land and interact with its people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/417cd4f772a928257aa888d80ad7915a.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More Equipment &amp; Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A more diverse equipment system, with the ability to change weapon skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 15 combat-style weapon types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufe5dSword &amp; Shield, Greatsword, Axe\ufe5e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufe5dSpear, Dual Blades, Daggers, Katana, Gauntlets\ufe5e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufe5dShortbow, Short Staff, Longbow, Long Staff, Holy Book, Dual Crossbows\ufe5e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufe5dHandgun, Shotgun, Sniper Rifle, Assault Rifle\ufe5e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 unique weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 types of equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200 unique skills and techniques</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An improved, easy-to-learn combat system\u2014switch between different weapon styles at any time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/5d4016eb9daac78179f24e0139598db9.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle Powerful Enemies and Claim Your Loot!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Haya World is filled with formidable foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up and upgrade your gear to take them on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They carry rich rewards just waiting to be claimed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/be41db4d68a03bcdb0cc4ec712225d00.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rich and glamorous, ever-changing fashion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new fashion system to make your character shine even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/980d6b940afdff2281b7e3ee2693ced7.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Go on an adventure with NPC companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're never alone\u2014team up with over 30 unique companions on your journey!<br>Collect over 10 types of companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/f2672554f91470175b3a1a573c70663d.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More Fun-Filled Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicles-Ride in style\u2014explore the vast world with 20 different vehicle styles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fishing-Become a master angler\u2014catch over 50 types of fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farming-Live off the land\u2014grow crops and farm in your own base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/6dfb9c9886e8b29f09b94dd846090ae2.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Controller Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can enjoy Haya World with an Xbox controller\u2014no additional setup required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is also fully playable on Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/4ccaa642352054c424765d1191a53fd8.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Online Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends through Steam's online features~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure together, create together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own unique Haya World together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/b06c08eddc4ff2033f93e5b6e6fd5fac.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hainya World EA 2.0 Major Update!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/d0b564b92a48ecd3a52115fd6a43c1df.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a whole year of development, it's finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've revamped many game mechanics, significantly enhanced the visuals, and added even more fun gameplay elements!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the Hainya World!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An RPG of Adventure x Creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig, build, battle, and explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight monsters, level up, break terrain, and gather materials to build your own base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The kingdom is under attack by monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To save it, adventurers set off to explore an ancient continent in search of untold mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/e8f846a1942e2fd7540a380691692ac8.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Venture into the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Ancient Land</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A forgotten ancient continent, where adventurers journey to investigate abnormal monster activity. Here, they can freely alter the terrain and construct structures to explore this unknown region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Narus Continent</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The homeland of adventurers and the main continent where the hainyaworld people live. It is home to many prosperous towns and residents. You can visit this land and interact with its people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/417cd4f772a928257aa888d80ad7915a.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More Equipment &amp; Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A more diverse equipment system, with the ability to change weapon skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 15 combat-style weapon types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufe5dSword &amp; Shield, Greatsword, Axe\ufe5e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufe5dSpear, Dual Blades, Daggers, Katana, Gauntlets\ufe5e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufe5dShortbow, Short Staff, Longbow, Long Staff, Holy Book, Dual Crossbows\ufe5e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufe5dHandgun, Shotgun, Sniper Rifle, Assault Rifle\ufe5e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 unique weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 types of equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200 unique skills and techniques</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An improved, easy-to-learn combat system\u2014switch between different weapon styles at any time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/5d4016eb9daac78179f24e0139598db9.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle Powerful Enemies and Claim Your Loot!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Haya World is filled with formidable foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up and upgrade your gear to take them on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They carry rich rewards just waiting to be claimed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/be41db4d68a03bcdb0cc4ec712225d00.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rich and glamorous, ever-changing fashion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new fashion system to make your character shine even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/980d6b940afdff2281b7e3ee2693ced7.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Go on an adventure with NPC companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're never alone\u2014team up with over 30 unique companions on your journey!<br>Collect over 10 types of companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/f2672554f91470175b3a1a573c70663d.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More Fun-Filled Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicles-Ride in style\u2014explore the vast world with 20 different vehicle styles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fishing-Become a master angler\u2014catch over 50 types of fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farming-Live off the land\u2014grow crops and farm in your own base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/6dfb9c9886e8b29f09b94dd846090ae2.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Controller Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can enjoy Haya World with an Xbox controller\u2014no additional setup required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is also fully playable on Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/4ccaa642352054c424765d1191a53fd8.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Online Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends through Steam's online features~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure together, create together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own unique Haya World together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299030/extras/b06c08eddc4ff2033f93e5b6e6fd5fac.avif?t=1747991749\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
